#basePath P0_Intro
#include "Header.leaf"

:: Preload
@function    ChapterPreload

$call SetBackground("bg/Room.png")

:: Start
@exposed
@trigger    ChapterStart
@cutscene
// Lock all location on map
$call SetInThreadLocks()
$call DisableMapButton()

// Mark start of phase
$set global:currentPhase = 0
// Mark start of thread
$set global:currentThread = "P0_Intro"

//{@}   
       //[This is the introductory thread in Phase 0.]

// TODO: Rest of thread here
{@You} 
       </i>I had this recurring dream, when I was a kid, about sea lamprey.</i>
       </i>I think it was something about their teeth that really got to me.</i> 
       </i>Maybe sleeping in my childhood bed again is what brought the dream back.</i> 

{@}
       You stand in front of the mirror you dented at 15, brushing your hair.

{@You} 
       </i>After all this time, it's hard to tell.</i> 

{@}
       A knock at the door. Your mom sticks her head inside. 

{@Mom}
       Ana, você tá pronta? 
       </b>[Ana, are you ready?]</b>

{@You}
       Tou sim. 
       </b>[Yeah, I am.]</b>

{@Mom}
       Ok. Tenha um bom dia hoje. Te amo. 
       </b>[Have a good day today. I love you.]</b>

{@You}
       Te amo também. 
       </b>[I love you, too.]</b>

{@}
       She steps out. 
       You put down the brush. 

{@You} 
       </i>No time like the present.</i> 
       </i>Right?</i>

//at this point we go to the sea grant building

{@}
       An older woman waits for you by the front door. Her badge says "Program Director". //title subject to change

{@Saoirse}
       Ana, right?

{@You}
       That's me. You must be Saoirse. 
       
{@Saoirse}
       It's nice to finally meet you. I hope the move wasn't too difficult. 

{@You}
       My dorm room was pretty much empty, so it wasn't too bad. 

{@Saoirse}
       Well, I hope working with us will be a good first experience post-college. 
       Speaking of working, you'll have to get started right away. Sorry about that. 

{@You}
       Don't worry - I get it. Let's hear the details. 

{@Renée}
       Local fishermen have been reporting bites on their fish. The fish they <i>can</i> catch, that is. 

{@}
       She hands you a photo. //insert photo of sea lamprey bite
       $call SetScenarioData("Scenario1")

{@You}
       Sea lamprey.

{@Saoirse}
       Yeah. This is what I need you to work on. I need a plan on how to manage the sea lamprey population. 
       The interventions we can take to maintain balance in the lakes. 
       Once you're ready to use a few possible interventions, then we'll go on to the intervention phase and use them. 

{@You}
       I mean, I know about conservation in general, but I don't know anything specific about sea lamprey. 
       Besides the teeth. 

{@Saoirse}
       You're in luck. There are plenty of people around here who have all the information you'll need. 
       Here, take this map. //map icon appears here maybe?
       $call EnableMapButton()
       In the intervention phase, you'll need to use action certificates implement different interventions. 
       To gain those action certificates, you need to first collect evidence chips. These chips describe the science behind possible interventions. 
       Then, you'll need to make sure you have the resources to actually implement the intervention. Once you've done that, you'll get an action certificate.
       This map will show you the locations where you can find evidence chips and action certificates. 

{@You}
       That's... a lot of info.

{@Saoirse}
       It is. If it helps, I like to use a journal to write down field notes. //note icon appears?
       You can have this one. We'll call it a first day gift. I've already left some notes in there for you.

{@You}
       Thanks. I appreciate it. 

{@Saoirse}
       Of course.

{@}
       She puts a hand on your shoulder.

{@Saoirse}
       I want you to be successful. I know you'll be. 

{@You}
       I hope so. 

{@}
       You open the map. You think about concentric circles of tiny teeth. 

{@You}
       </i>No time like the present, huh.</i>

{@}
       You begin.
       [Open your map to continue]

// go to map, end phase 0
// skip to end
$goto .End

:: End
@exposed
// TODO: Unlock next locations
// $call UnlockLocation([Location 1])
// $call UnlockLocation([Location 2])

// Mark end of thread
$set global:currentThread = "NONE"
// Go to Phase 1 Hub
$goto P1_Hub.Entry
